    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia Yehowa diakalua kundi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muana wa muntu, wewe udi mushikame munkatshi mua ba mu tshisamba etshi tshia bantombokedi, badi ne mesu a kumona nʼau kadi kabena bamona, badi ne matshu a kunyua nʼau kadi kabena bunvua; hualu bua badi diku dia bantombokedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku, muana wa muntu, udilongoluele bintu bia luendu lua kuya ku buhika, wenze nunku mu munya ku mesu kuabo; Umuka mu muaba webe bua kuya ku muaba mukuabo ku mesu kuabo; bumue nebelangane meji a muanda eu, nansha bikalabo bena diku dia bantombokedi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hatula bintu biebe bia luendu mu munya ku mesu kuabo, bu mudi bintu bia kuya nʼabi mu buhika; mu diba dia dilolo wewe muine uhatuke mu nsubu ku mesu kuabo, bu mudi bantu benza hadibo baya mu buhika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Utubule disoso mu tshimanu tshia nsubu ku mesu kuabo, hatukilaku ne bintu biebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ambula bintu biebe bia luendu ha diaha ku mesu kuabo, luhuka nʼabi butuku; buikila mesu ebe bua wewe kutangidi buloba; bualu bua nakukuteka bu tshimanyinu kudi ba mu tshisamba tshia Bena Isalele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakenza bu muakangambileye. Nakahatula bintu bianyi bia luendu mu munya, bu mudi bintu bia kuya nʼabi mu buhika; hakabuela diba, nakaluhula disoso mu tshimanu tshia nsubu ne tshianza tshianyi, nakahatukilaku nʼabi butuku ne nakabituala ha diaha dianyi ku mesu kuabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakatshiabu, dî dia Yehowa diakalua kundi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muana wa muntu, ba mu tshisamba tshia Bena Isalele, ba mu diku edi dia bantombokedi mene, kabakukukonka ne, Wewe udi wenza tshinyi, anyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubambile ne, Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Di edi dia Yehowa didi dikuata mukelenge wa mu Yelushalema ne bonso ba mu tshisamba tshia Bena Isalele badi mu musoko eu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ubambile ne, Meme hanyi ndi tshimanyinu kunudi. Nebanuenzele bu munakuenza, nenuye mu buloba bua bende, mu buhika mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge udi munkatshi muenu neambule bintu biandi bia luendu ha diaha diandi, nealuhuke butuku; nebamutubuile disoso mu lumbu lua musoko bua kumuluhuilamu; yeye neabuikile mpala wandi bua katangidi buloba ebu ku mesu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nengande bukuondo ku mpala kuandi, yeye neakuatshibue mu buteyi buanyi; nenye nʼandi ku Babulona, ku buloba bua Bena Kasada; kena ubumona ku mesu, kadi neafuilemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nemmuangalashe badi nʼandi, bakuatshishi bandi ne masalayi andi onso, ku mpehele yonso; nempatule muele wa nvita bua kubihata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nebamanye ne, Ndi Yehowa, hanabamuangalasha munkatshi mua bisamba bikuabo ne hanabatangadisha mu maloba a bende. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi nensungile bantu banya-banya ba munkatshi muabo ku muele wa nvita, ku tshiole ne ku tshihuhu, bua bobo batondele ba mu bisamba bia kudibo baya malu a bundu akadibo benza; nunku nebamanye ne, Ndi Yehowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia Yehowa diakalua kundi kabidi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muana wa muntu, dia bidia ne dikanka, nua mai ne dizakala ne buowa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ambila ba mu buloba ebu ne, Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba bua badi bashikame mu Yelushalema mu buloba bua Isalele ne, Nebadie bidia biabo ne kuhampakana, nebanue mai abo ne tutshina; bua buloba buabo nebuikale tshikulu, nebuhaudibue ne bintu bionso bidimu, bualu bua ditomboka dia bantu bonso badi bashikamemu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Misoko idi ne bantu neyibutudibue, buloba nebuandamuke tshihela tshia tshianana; nunku nenumanye ne, Ndi Yehowa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dî dia Yehowa diakalua kundi ne, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muana wa muntu, elu ndusumuinu kai lunudi nʼalu mu buloba bua Isalele ne, Matuku adi aleha ne tshikena kumona tshionso tshidi tshihanga kuenza bualu buatshi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua muanda eu ubambile ne, Mukelenge Yehowa udi wamba ne, Nendekeshe lusumuinu elu, ne kabena baluela bu lusumuinu mu buloba bua Isalele kabidi. Kadi ubambile ne, Matuku akukumbana ne tshikena kumona tshionso netshijadikibue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kakuena kuikala tshikena kumona tshia kudinga nʼatshi bantu kabidi, anyi kutempa kua mbuku kua mei a lubombo munkatshi mua ba mu tshisamba tshia Bena Isalele. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bualu bua meme Yehowa nengambe dî dianyi, ne dî dindi ngamba nedijadikibue, kadiena dijanguluka kabidi. Bua mu matuku enu, nuenu ba mu diku dia bantombokedi, nengambe dî dianyi, nendimane; â mmei adi Mukelenge Yehowa wamba.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
